      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O’Farrell Property is delighted to present this superb 3 bedroom / 3 bathroom semi-detached home, ideally positioned just off the Sleaty Road in Brotherton. Presented in fantastic condition throughout, the property offers spacious and well-appointed accommodation, together with an impressive range of features including a primary bedroom ensuite, three generous double bedrooms, extensive understairs storage, modern fitted kitchen, water softener system, EPH zoning system, burglar alarm and much more. It is vacant, ready to go and a chain-free sale. \r\n\r\nThe property occupies an enviable position within the development, situated at the entrance in a quiet cul-de-sac with no passing traffic and overlooking extensive green recreational areas. To the front, there is generous private off-street parking on a cobblelock driveway, complemented by additional communal parking bays nearby. A secure side entrance leads to the exceptionally private, south-facing rear garden, which is not overlooked and features a garden shed and outdoor tap.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from a B3 BER rating, making it eligible for a green-rate mortgage. It was constructed c. 2006 and extends to c. 100m2 throughout. \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with excellent understairs storage, leading to a spacious living room overlooking the large green area to the front. The living room features a large bay window and attractive open fireplace with provisions for a gas fire.\r\n\r\nTo the rear is the generously proportioned kitchen, fitted with a range of modern wall and floor units and enjoying direct access to the private south-facing rear garden through double doors. The ground floor is completed by a separate utility room with countertop and plumbing for appliances, and a convenient guest WC just off of the utility.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the landing provides access to the attic and leads to three generously sized double bedrooms, two of which benefit from fitted wardrobes. The primary bedroom is positioned to the rear of the property and features a private ensuite bathroom. A spacious family bathroom completes the first floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe location is excellent, situated just off the N80 main road and within easy walking distance of a wide range of local amenities. The property is also conveniently served by the CW2 Local Link bus route, providing excellent connectivity to the surrounding area.\r\n\r\nThis is a wonderful opportunity to acquire a spacious, well-maintained home in a particularly attractive position within the development and a chain-free sale. \r\n\r\nHallway\r\nTiled flooring, understairs storage\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nFeature open fireplace, timber flooring, bay window\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room\r\nModern fitted kitchen with wall & floor units, tiled flooring, tiled splash back, patio doors to rear garden\r\n\r\nUtility\r\nCountertop, plumbed for appliances, tiled flooring\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\nWC, WHB, tiled flooring\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nCarpeted, attic access, hot press\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nFitted wardrobes, carpeted, en-suite, to rear of property\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\nWC, WHB, shower, tiled flooring, tiled wet areas\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nFitted wardrobes, carpeted, to front of property\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nCarpeted, to rear of property\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nWC, WHB, bath, shower, tiled flooring, tiled wet areas\r\n\r\nServices: mains water, mains sewage, electricity, gas heating, burglar alarm\r\n\r\nEircode: R93 N7P6"
      },
